### 12. BUDGET AND FINANCIAL CONDITIONS

PIRAC wishes to prioritise an activation proportionate to the nature and scale of the campaign, while maximising regional reach and keeping costs under control.

The budget allocated to collaborations with micro-influencers is estimated at approximately **€4,000.**

